<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>เติมเครดิต - Welloff System</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        input, textarea, select { font-size: 16px !important; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 pb-12 font-sans antialiased text-gray-900">
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
    
    <div class="max-w-md mx-auto mt-6 md:mt-10 px-4">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg border border-gray-100">
            <div class="text-center mb-8">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-2xl shadow-sm">
                    <i class="fas fa-wallet"></i>
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-800">เติมเครดิต</h1>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">สแกน QR Code ด้านล่างเพื่อชำระเงิน</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mb-8 text-center bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100">
                <img src="/uploads/slips/images/qr-code.png" alt="QR Code" class="w-48 h-48 mx-auto rounded-xl shadow-sm mb-4 object-contain bg-white p-2">
                <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-800">ธนาคาร: กสิกรไทย (KBANK)</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">ชื่อบัญชี: จิรภัทร พงษ์เสวี</p>
                <p class="text-lg font-mono font-bold text-blue-600 mt-2 bg-blue-50 py-1 px-3 rounded-lg inline-block">123-4-56789-0</p>
            </div>
            
            <form action="/api/topup" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="space-y-5">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1.5">จำนวนเงินที่โอน (บาท)</label>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <span class="absolute left-4 top-3.5 text-gray-400 font-bold">฿</span>
                        <input type="number" name="amount" required step="0.01"
                            class="w-full bg-gray-50 border-gray-200 border p-3.5 pl-10 rounded-xl focus:bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none transition text-base" 
                            placeholder="เช่น 500">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1.5">แนบรูปสลิปโอนเงิน (หลักฐาน)</label>
                    <input type="file" name="slip" accept="image/*" required 
                        class="w-full bg-gray-50 border-gray-200 border p-3 rounded-xl focus:bg-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none transition text-base file:mr-4 file:py-2.5 file:px-4 file:rounded-lg file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-blue-50 file:text-blue-700 hover:file:bg-blue-100 cursor-pointer">
                </div>
                
                <button type="submit" class="w-full mt-4 bg-blue-600 text-white py-3.5 md:py-4 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-blue-700 shadow-lg shadow-blue-200 transform hover:-translate-y-1 transition duration-200 text-base">
                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle mr-1"></i> แจ้งเติมเครดิต
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>